1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,072
So far our oscillators run for ever.

2
00:00:03,072 --> 00:00:04,479
Real ones do not.

3
00:00:04,479 --> 00:00:10,755
Air resistance and friction take a little energy every cycle, and the swings die away.

4
00:00:10,755 --> 00:00:12,812
This is damped oscillation.

